TODUQ — Task-Oriented Dialogue Uncertainty Quantification

DATA + DERIVED DATA ARTIFACTS
=============================
This repository derives from the Schema-Guided Dialogue (SGD) dataset, released
by Google Research under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0). All dataset artifacts in this repository
(modified utterances, annotations, and derived records) are therefore
distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

  License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Attribution:
  Rastogi, A., Zang, X., Sunkara, S., Gupta, R., & Khaitan, P. (2020).
  "Towards Scalable Multi-domain Conversational Agents: The Schema-Guided
  Dialogue Dataset." AAAI 2020.

You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate
if changes were made. Because TODUQ intentionally *modifies* SGD turns, changes
ARE made and are recorded per-record in the `passes` provenance fields. Derived
data must be shared under the same license (ShareAlike).

